BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yo (Love is a Rebellious Bird)
DTSTART:20260510T190000Z
DTEND:20260510T203500Z
DTSTAMP:20260510T190000Z
UID:N8ajGKaO43
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 78 mins (1h18m)\n\nA vibrant intergenerational frien
 dship forms between Yo\, 72\, and director Anna\, 24. After Yo’s passing
  at 89\, Anna recreates her world through building a miniature house and p
 uppet\, weaving memories into an intimate vérité portrait.Director Anna 
 Fitch scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/yo-(love-is-a-
 rebellious-bird)\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 3 (Sat 9 May\, 5:
 00 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 12:15
LOCATION:PACCAR IMAX Theater at Pacific Science Center\, None
